# Build artifacts
**/dist-newstyle
**/.stack-work
**/target
**/node_modules
**/elm-stuff
# Elixir: never copy host-compiled artifacts or fetched deps into the build
# context — the umbrella Dockerfile runs a clean `mix deps.get`/`mix compile`
# under MIX_ENV=prod inside the image. Copying the host's elixir/_build (built
# for dev/test) or elixir/deps would corrupt the prod release.
**/_build
**/deps
**/cover
**/erl_crash.dump
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
# VCS / docs / dev tooling not needed at build time
.git
.gitignore
.github
docs
*.md
docker-compose*.yml
Makefile
scripts

# Editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
*.swp

# Local config / state
.hm-dev-env
